   "widgets_values": [
    "## Wire into MiniMax H3\n\n**MiniMax H3 Image to Video** (core): `first_frame`, `last_frame`, `width`, `height`, `length` from **H3 Shot**; put its `prompt` in your H3 prompt (e.g. MiniMax H3 Prompt Format, mode fl2va).\n\nThe last frame is the anchor carried to where the camera ends, so H3 performs the move you drew. Revealed edges are gray - for pans, render the path with the Feedback Sampler first and feed those frames instead.\n\nLonger than 20 s: raise `segment`, and use each segment's last frame as the next first frame."
   ]
  }
